title: "oduncu"
abstract: "A silent-executor skill for coding agents. Given a task the agent says \"yaparım...\", does the work, and says \"tamam.\" — no explanation, summary, code block, progress note or task list in between. One SKILL.md installs into Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity, Gemini CLI, Cursor and the Agent Skills standard."
